Bartender
Job description

Steak Club Leidse is looking for a Bartender/Waiter!

We are a New York inspired Steak Restaurant & Bar, located in the heart of Amsterdam at Leidseplein. With our delicious menu (from the best dry aged meats like our perfectly grilled Tomahawk or côte de boeuf, or our juicy burgers), signature cocktails, our art deco interior and an ambiance that feels wonderfully Metropolitan, we want to offer our guests the ultimate experience. During the evening you will notice that the DJ turns up the volume and his beats become more up-tempo so that our guests can dance until late. What is still missing in this picture is YOU as Bartender/Cocktail shaker!

What do we ask of a Bartender/Cocktail shaker?

  - Flexibility, we offer afternoon, evening, night and weekend shifts;

  - Enthusiasm, what you know how to convey to the guests and your colleagues;

  - You are hospitable and guest-oriented;

  - You are eager to learn and motivated;

  - You speak and understand Dutch and/or English;

  - You have notable experience with making alcoholic drinks and cocktails.

What can we offer a Bartender/Waiter?

  - A salary between €12 and €17.50 per hour, depending on your age and experience;

  - A good tip (which goes up to hundreds of euros per month);

  - A full-time or part-time job, you can start working with us from 8 hours a week;

  - 25 paid vacation days (based on a full-time contract);

  - A very nice working environment and colleagues;

  - Drinks, parties & team outings;

  - High-level training, we make you a real hospitality star;

  - Discount on food and/or drinks when you come by in your spare time.

Would you like to work with us as a Bartender/Cocktail shaker?! Then click on the Apply button and complete your application!

